  "prefLabel": "Odb 202.03 Presiding officer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Odb 202.03 “Presiding officer” means the chairman of the board, or in the absence of the chairman, the vice chairman of the board.\n\nSource. #12941, eff 12-15-19",
